      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu Masters up to rank five are mortals; rank six are immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        101
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu Masters at rank five peak stage are at the peak of the mortal world, an emperor among Gu Masters. For many at that height, the stated goal is to break away from mortal and charge through to the rank six Gu Immortal realm, thereby gaining a longer life.",
      "chapters": [
        373
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "peak-of-the-mortal-world",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mortal Gu Masters finish at rank five peak stage.",
      "chapters": [
        609
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "peak-of-the-mortal-world",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_mortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Initial stage is light purple, middle stage violet purple, upper stage deep purple, and peak stage crystal purple.",
      "chapters": [
        379
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "purple-crystal-stages",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu Yue clan history treats the rung as rare: the academy can name only two rank five masters, and the clan has never had a rank six Gu Master.",
      "chapters": [
        7
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
